{"id":"n90901-4-7","stage":5,"title":"달아오르다 · 火热","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90901-4-7-1","ko":"시간이 늦었으니 그만 집에 가 봐야겠어요.","zh":"时间不早了，我该回家了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间，空儿","explanation":"시간：时间，空儿；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"3","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이","audio":"/audio/cecaa2f0353f97459090.mp3"}},{"text":"늦었으니","meaning":"缓慢，晚","explanation":"늦다：缓慢，晚；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64526","senseId":"2","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦었으니","audio":"/audio/84b62e02aacfbe921ba5.mp3"}},{"text":"그만","meaning":"就那样，到此为止","explanation":"그만：就那样，到此为止。","readings":[{"term":"그만","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36428","senseId":"3","lemma":"그만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3"}},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"가","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가","audio":"/audio/64ee5293d31bc58b72d7.mp3"}},{"text":"봐야겠어요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","au